1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,680
In 1822, a Scottish

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,660
soldier sold London a country that

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,570
did not exist.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:05,750
It was called Poyais.

5
00:00:06,217 --> 00:00:08,280
Gregor MacGregor arrived calling himself

6
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,580
its prince. Poyais, he said, had rich

7
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,660
land, rivers full of fish, and a capital

8
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,470
with a theater.

9
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,300
There was even a guidebook, by a Captain

10
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,550
Thomas Strangeways.

11
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,290
There was no Captain Strangeways.

12
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,910
He printed Poyais money.

13
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,430
He sold Poyais land.

14
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,090
Then he sold Poyais bonds.

15
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,790
£200,000 of them.

16
00:00:25,003 --> 00:00:26,150
And people started packing.

17
00:00:26,611 --> 00:00:28,440
Two ships of settlers sailed for Central

18
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,170
America. They found no capital.

19
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,750
No theater. No town.

20
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,530
Just jungle.

21
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,020
Luckily, they had brought plenty of

22
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:34,830
Poyais money.

23
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,780
Unluckily, nobody had ever heard of

24
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,300
it.

25
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:38,690
Most of them never came home.

26
00:00:39,151 --> 00:00:39,850
Why did it work?

27
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,830
Nobody could check.

28
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,610
It's like buying a house from photos.

29
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,420
The nicer the pictures, the fewer the

30
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:44,940
questions.

31
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,120
When the news reached London, MacGregor

32
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,090
was in France, selling Poyais again.

33
00:00:49,342 --> 00:00:51,130
He was put on trial, and walked free.

34
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,040
The best lie is a place nobody can

35
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:53,560
visit.
